WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.113
Today we will select colours intentionally. Our work connects with our own local

00:00:05.113 --> 00:00:05.491
community.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.161
Choose three colours that suit your chosen message.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.863
Test the colours in small labelled boxes.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:17.972
Circle the most readable combination and plan where to use it.
